### ==========================================
### 租户管理 — Tenant Management
### 路径前缀：/tenant
### 权限：需要 tenant:admin 权限码或 super_admin 角色
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 租户列表 -------------------
### @name Get All Tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenant/list HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 租户详情 -------------------
### @name Get Tenant Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenant/detail?id=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 创建租户 -------------------
### @name Create Tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "tenant_b",
  "name": "B公司",
  "contactName": "李四",
  "contactPhone": "13900139000",
  "address": "北京市朝阳区",
  "domain": "b-company.com",
  "intro": "B公司租户",
  "status": "1"
}

### ------------------- 更新租户 -------------------
### @name Update Tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/update?id=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "B公司（已更新）",
  "contactName": "李四",
  "contactPhone": "13900139001",
  "status": "1"
}

### ------------------- 删除租户（级联）-------------------
### @name Delete Tenant
# 级联删除：关联的 role_scope_menu、user_scope_role、tenant_quota、
# menu、role、sub-tenant、user 全部清理。默认租户（id=1）禁止删除
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/delete?id=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
